{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0593_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8bdaca26ebbeefed07c78535e3bc39d42ced3c6b813e0ae91f5e6a0105e25c4b", "ja": "（新年はイベント目白押しで大忙しだ。今日も\nこれから、春香と収録へ向かう予定だが……）", "zh": "（新年活动接连不断，忙得不可开交。今天也正准备和春香一起去录制，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0593_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "47785fdc0b37e2913fdb7e3ffb04403c37ce3c4da4bacea59081ad8d9337f81d", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです！\nすみません、ちょっと遅れちゃって。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了！\n对不起，我稍微迟到了一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0593_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b16b30ae37270cb9d2281d7fc06ce5bc830cae9f4940e11bbfc8538d2738e4b6", "ja": "お疲れ様。大丈夫だよ、まだ余裕はあるから。\nこちらこそ、新年からバタバタで申し訳ない。", "zh": "辛苦了。没关系，还来得及。\n反倒是我不好，新年一开始就让你跟着忙个不停。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0593_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "a05904d8a2c29627e0b541c281eed7d03e072bd275ba2804f14bca0a7e6fb9dd", "ja": "いえ、そんなことないですよ！　たくさん\nお仕事を任せてもらえて嬉しいです。", "zh": "不会，没那回事啦！能接到这么多\n工作交给我，我开心还来不及呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0593_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "4d7f15ad973e7749a97aaab24b0949df294076f78f2d98e0d4b4f40c157eb20e", "ja": "それに……ふふっ。早速ご利益があったなぁって、\nおみくじの効果を実感してるくらいで。", "zh": "而且……呵呵，我都感觉到抽签的效果了，觉得这下马上就得到庇佑了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0593_1005_p", "source_sha256": "2b4840a07e483fb169bd632fe89e2ea2db2e21b22f4022f31c56f4cb96887c5f", "ja": "おみくじ？", "zh": "抽签？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0593_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "7da1b6d7844679204464280c3793377d3198f276b6e2d1a72d65f3168abb4e0d", "ja": "はい。家族で初詣に行ったんですけど……\nその時、大吉を引いたんです！", "zh": "是的。我和家人一起去新年参拜了……\n那时候抽到了大吉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0593_1007_001har", "source_sha256": "cfb4d6034e91b327a492a733f824bcb5931047aacc20cfbbc02fb9556f2d65cd", "ja": "しかも、仕事運が抜群によくって！\n今年一年、自信を持ってお仕事に挑めるなあって。", "zh": "而且，工作运特别好！\n感觉今年一整年都能充满自信地投入工作了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0593_1008_p", "source_sha256": "e9b335e519b95ca7204d7cca3b4b0ca455c485b910da2e7c22f24e58742c7c90", "ja": "おお、それはよかったじゃないか。\nよほどいいことが書いてあったんだな。", "zh": "哦，那不是很好嘛。\n看来上面写了相当不错的内容啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0593_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "739142dd8e746ff60079c145dc0badf19e9cd09cda48e641417753f3b6d32680", "ja": "えへへ♪　「吉運来たる。高き壁あれど、\n日々の精進にて必ずや乗り越えられん」だそうです。", "zh": "嘿嘿♪　上面写着：“吉运将至。虽有高墙，凭日复一日的努力，定能跨越。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0593_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "88e7d819640b59951a8df830d92690a6d8bbc970a1153a7fd71b615bcdc6d80d", "ja": "まだまだ、アイドルとしては未熟ですし、\n乗り越えなきゃいけない壁もたくさんありますけど。", "zh": "虽然作为偶像我还很不成熟，\n也还有很多必须跨越的高墙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0593_1011_001har", "source_sha256": "5767c6b3a3ee7645a2d6784b4fa938ad77e64e87f5a7d793cef5a613d1f325b4", "ja": "でも、努力すれば大丈夫って、安心できました！　\nきっと今の忙しさも、成長のための時間なのかなって♪", "zh": "不过，我也安心了，只要努力就没问题！  \n我想，现在这段忙碌的时光，一定也是为了成长吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0593_1012_p", "source_sha256": "0996cbd85b4004335c630b96b8ec4c3411e2d1ea433329b82dc61bc1911f0874", "ja": "はは、そうだな。春香ならきっと大丈夫だよ。\nしかし……一番気になるのが、仕事運なんだな。", "zh": "哈哈，说得也是。春香的话肯定没问题。\n不过……最让人在意的还是工作运势啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0593_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "93690273db17c06c532e612185877d89851fa799570df10a434d95327f7a4b38", "ja": "え、なにか変でしたか？", "zh": "咦，有什么奇怪的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0593_1014_p", "source_sha256": "5e5a71f2f772ef8e915819fcfcbebbdb0b55a23c096cd574af09c01a191b3573", "ja": "いや、本当に仕事が好きなんだなって思って。\n高校生なら、他に気になることもありそうだけど。", "zh": "没有，只是觉得你真的很喜欢工作啊。\n毕竟换作普通高中生，往往会有其他在意的事情吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0593_1015_001har", "source_sha256": "64e52282f85560e0e6942f5918a3c69f8eff2f4675cda5d7471cdc5751e0d8f3", "ja": "他ですか？　それは……その……れ、\nあ。いえ、やっぱり何でもないですっ！　えへへ……。", "zh": "其他方面吗？那……那个……我——\n啊，不，还是算了，没什么！嘿嘿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0593_1016_p", "source_sha256": "fbde93b20c39a856ecb3107a310e5e98cb6dd9425cf02a7f4ce4f89a4a0caf0e", "ja": "ん？　でもまあ、わかるよ。\n学業とか、どうしても気になっちゃうよな……。", "zh": "嗯？不过嘛，我能理解。\n学业之类的，总归还是会让人在意啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0593_1017_001har", "source_sha256": "de85bece361e1562c8b906b0305a08c2000cb862f505785d01f3570932b42476", "ja": "えへへ、ちょーっと惜しいかなー……っていうか、\nあはは……今はそれよりも、お仕事が第一ですからっ♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，差一点点啦——该怎么说呢，\n啊哈哈……现在还是工作第一嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
